In this lab, I explored how Wireshark can be used to follow TCP streams and examine conversations between devices on a network.

The exercise helped me understand how network communication can be reconstructed and how examining the exchanged data can reveal useful information during an investigation.

## What I Worked On

- Examining captured network traffic.
- Following TCP streams in Wireshark.
- Analysing communication between devices.
- Investigating the data exchanged within TCP connections.
- Completing all 10 tasks in the lab.

## What I Learned

I learned how TCP streams help reconstruct network conversations and how this feature can make it easier to investigate and understand network activity.

